    "summary": "\u201cLife is a journey. Education is a journey.\u201d \ud83e\uddd1\ud83c\udf93 \ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udf93\n\nThis was the message that filled the Marae as we celebrated our M\u0101ori \u0101konga (students) on achieving a significant milestone - graduation. In an educational journey filled with bumpy roads and joyous trails, no graduate carried on alone. Pouako (teachers), wh\u0101nau and friends were there to support and uplift them, not just with each step forward but also during setbacks.\n \n#Whakamihi \n#MahiTikaAna\n#GraduationWeek\n#TukuTaonga\n#GetMoreYourYourFuture",
